cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Evo-Engram: simulation and analysis code for embedding model migration in a semantic distributed hash table"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/EngramProtocol/Evo_Engram"
abstract: >-
  Simulation and analysis code for Evo-Engram, a design for replacing the
  embedding model of a semantic distributed hash table while the index stays
  searchable. The repository contains retrieval probes, placement and
  migration simulators, a discrete-event Kademlia overlay simulator, data
  preparation scripts for CodeSearchNet and SciFact, the preregistration and
  checksum manifest of each evaluation round, and the analysis scripts that
  print the reported results. Each evaluation round is frozen at a git tag.
